accTitle: One market record, from Kafka to a connected browser
accDescr: A Kafka consumer reads over Direct Connect, publishes with KPL to Kinesis, and Lambda sends the update through the WebSocket management API.
 K[On-premises Kafka] -->|records over Direct Connect| EC[EC2 Kafka consumers]
 EC -->|KPL publishes records| Stream[Kinesis Data Streams]
 Stream -->|event-source mapping| L[Lambda processor]
 Browser[Authorized browser] -->|connect| WS[API Gateway WebSocket API]
 WS -->|store connection ID| IDs[Connection registry]
 IDs -->|active IDs| L
 L -->|PostToConnection| WS
 WS -->|market update| Browser
